-- TYPE MISMATCH -------------------------------------- src/OutputController.elm

The 1st argument to `list` is not what I expect:

179|                     presentation = E.object [("viewProtocol",E.int 1),("kind",E.string "view-commit"),("projection",frame settled),("requests",E.list identity []),("focus",E.list identity [])]
                                                                                                                                                           ^^^^^^^^
This `identity` value is a:

    Scope -> Counter

But `list` needs the 1st argument to be:

    Scope -> E.Value

